    "Verrou can check your passwords with Have I Been Pwned. Only the first 5 characters of their SHA-1 hash go out: neither the passwords nor their full hash leave this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou peut vérifier vos mots de passe auprès de Have I Been Pwned. Seuls les 5 premiers caractères de leur empreinte SHA-1 partent : ni les mots de passe, ni leur empreinte complète ne quittent ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verrou can't copy the link: Vaultwarden only gives it to the invited person's email.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou ne peut pas copier le lien : Vaultwarden ne le donne qu'à l'e-mail de la personne invitée."
