      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Windows (app de bureau)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans dossier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without an account on the server, the person creates it with the link received (in Verrou: “Create an Account” on the login screen, pasting the link). Once the invitation is accepted, you will confirm it by checking their key's fingerprint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans compte sur le serveur, la personne le crée avec le lien reçu (dans Verrou : « Créer un compte » sur l'écran de connexion, en collant le lien). Une fois l'invitation acceptée, vous la confirmerez en vérifiant l'empreinte de sa clé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without an account, the person creates one with the link received (Verrou: “Create an account” at sign-in). With an account, they paste the link into “Join an organization”. You will then confirm them by verifying their fingerprint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans compte, la personne le crée avec le lien reçu (Verrou : « Créer un compte » à la connexion). Avec un compte, elle colle le lien dans « Rejoindre une organisation ». Vous la confirmerez ensuite en vérifiant son empreinte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mots"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words: %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mots : %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Année"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are no longer part of this shared vault.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous ne faites plus partie de ce coffre partagé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are notified when they have accepted: compare their fingerprint phrase, then confirm them here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous êtes prévenu quand elle a accepté : comparez sa phrase d'empreinte, puis confirmez-la ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't manage this collection": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous ne gérez pas cette collection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You joined %@. An administrator still has to confirm your account: you will be notified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez rejoint %@. Un administrateur doit encore confirmer votre compte : vous serez prévenu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You left %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez quitté %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must be able to edit the item and see its password": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il faut pouvoir modifier l'élément et en voir le mot de passe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You now have access to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez maintenant accès à %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will be able to choose a new master password for their account (from the web vault).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pourrez choisir un nouveau mot de passe principal pour son compte (depuis le coffre web)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will be able to see the items of their vault, without changing them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pourrez voir les éléments de son coffre, sans les modifier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will be asked for the key twice: to create its credential, then to read its secret.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La clé vous sera demandée deux fois : pour créer son accréditation, puis pour lire son secret."
          }
